                "accordion_row_BqDTre": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Cancellation",
                    "open_by_default": true,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_N7Xam8": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>You can cancel for a full refund any time before we begin printing — typically within one business day of your order. Email <strong>studio.everstory@gmail.com</strong> as soon as possible.</p><p>Once printing starts, the order cannot be refunded. The work is yours.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_N7Xam8"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_twRhnM": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "ORDER DETAILS YOU PROVIDE",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_zxpk9g": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>At checkout, you upload your photograph(s) and share details that matter — name for the header, any specific request (a face we should not crop, a tone you prefer, a detail we should keep crisp). The more specific your notes, the closer the result matches your expectation. We work directly from what you provide; we do not send a mockup for approval.</p><p>If your photograph genuinely cannot be used (too low resolution, too blurry to cut around), we will email you before we begin. In that case you can replace the photo or cancel for a full refund.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_zxpk9g"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_xr3ViN": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Print defects",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_NRq3Fz": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>If your sheet arrives with a print or cutting defect — visible color shift, lamination flaws, misaligned cuts, or visible damage — we will reprint and reship at no cost. Email us within <strong>7 days of delivery </strong>with a photo of the issue at <a href=\"mailto:studio.everstory@gmail.com\"><strong>studio.everstory@gmail.com</strong></a>.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_NRq3Fz"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_BhTiTT": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Photo quality & personal preference",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_m6gUaQ": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>We use the photograph you upload, with our standard background removal and color correction, and we apply the details you share at checkout. We cannot refund or reprint based on personal preference about how the photo turned out — the order notes at checkout are your moment to be specific.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_m6gUaQ"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_Cq7FbW": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "damage and issues",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_WGUPxg": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Please inspect your order upon reception and contact us immediately if the item is defective, damaged, or if you receive the wrong item, so that we can evaluate the issue and make it right.</p><p>Email <strong>studio.everstory@gmail.com</strong> within 7 days of delivery with a clear photo of the issue. We do not accept physical returns — once we verify the issue from your photo, we reprint and reship at no cost, or refund per the Refunds section below.</p><p>Please do not mail items back. Items sent to us without a return request are discarded and not processed.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_WGUPxg"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_4YhxFg": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "exceptions / non returnable items",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_t94UAC": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Certain types of items cannot be returned. The following are non-returnable:</p><p>- All Everstory Studio sticker sheets — they are custom, made-to-order products built from a photograph you provide (custom and personalized items are non-returnable under standard retail practice)<br/>- Returns based on personal preference about how the photograph turned out — your checkout notes are the moment to be specific (see ORDER DETAILS YOU PROVIDE)<br/>- Sale items and gift cards</p><p>Damaged or defective items are covered separately under DAMAGES AND ISSUES.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_t94UAC"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_QdeAXa": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "exchanges",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_wBbVgr": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>We do not exchange items based on personal preference. If your sheet has a verified print or cutting defect, we will reprint and reship at no cost — this is a replacement, not an exchange. The fastest way to receive a different design is to place a separate new order; if a refund is appropriate it will follow the REFUNDS section below.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
